# Build context is the repository root; send only what the two Dockerfiles copy.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
apps/api/app/modules/clinical_kg/data/terms_to_translate.jsonl

# The kg-qa sub-project is not part of the image; only its graph and terminology data are.
apps/kg-qa/*
!apps/kg-qa/data
apps/kg-qa/data/annotated_data
